window.products.push({"id":928005,"name":"10 Live Coral Ricordea Frags Reef Saltwater","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YHyp1-J8L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Ricordeabox is proud to offer a great variety of hand collected Ricordea from the warm waters of the Florida Keys. In fact the varieties we sell are often referred to as Florida Ricordea. Ricordea can also be found in the Pacific and those varieties are referred to as Yuma Ricordea. Ricordea Coral, Ricordea Mushroom – It’s All The Same Ricordea go by various names. Some people call them Ricordea, others Ricordea Mushroom. Many Standout Features and Easy To Care For In Your MarineTank One of the reasons why these are very popular with hobbyists is their bright colors which include blue, green, orange and red more. Their bodies are basically round in shape and covered with small bulbous tentacles and grow to be about 2 to 3\" in diameter. Ricordea also have a mouth and can have even more than one mouth. They are also very easy to maintain and good for the beginning aquarist. They generally reproduce rapidly in captivity and spread over rockwork moving toward the light. Ricordea are photosynthetic. Once placed inside your tank, be sure to keep a low to moderate water flow and moderate lighting too. As for food, phyto-plankton and zoo-plankton will do. All these reasons along with their bright vivid colors make them a very desirable addition to any saltwater water aquarium. You will receive 10 ricordea mounted on 1.5 \"ceramic plugs. They are each individually packaged in specimen containers. Then are placed in a 6 mil. poly bag and then into a styrofoam overnight shipping container. A cool pack or heat bag is placed inside dependent on weather conditions. Shipped UPS Next day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YHyp1-J8L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09DK5D6RC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DK5D6RC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DK5D6RC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
