window.products.push({"id":928068,"name":"Le Creuset Stoneware Medium 4-Quart Canister, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tFzBd2p3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Available in increasing capacities of 2-1/4 quarts, 4 quarts, and 5 quarts, the graduated series of stoneware canisters by Le Creuset features tight-fitting lids that keep coffee, sugar, tea, flour, cookies, and candies fresh and easily accessible. This medium 4-quart stoneware canister, which measures approximately 7-1/2 by 7-1/2 by 11 inches, makes a lovely addition to any kitchen countertop or pantry. For an added touch of charm, it sports the Le Creuset name in raised letters and Le Creuset's signature concentric rings on the body and lid. Le Creuset's line of stoneware comes with a hard-wearing, impermeable finish fired at temperatures as high as 2192 degrees F. With a porosity level of less than 1 percent, it blocks moisture absorption, which can lead to cracking, crazing, and rippling along the interior. Its non-porous construction also resists odors, scratching, and staining for hygienic use and optimal performance. Even more, its high-quality enamel protects against metal marks and other damage, which means it's safe to use with knives. Best of all, the glaze on the exterior makes the stoneware items fun to mix and match with other coordinating Le Creuset pieces (sold separately), while a neutral-colored glaze on the inside offers an optimal palette for food presentation. And thanks to an unmatched thermal resistance from -65 degrees F to 500 degrees F, Le Creuset stoneware moves effortlessly from the microwave or oven (or under the broiler) to the table for serving to the refrigerator or freezer for storing leftovers. When finished, it cleans up easily by hand or in the dishwasher. Amazon.com Collect all three of Le Creuset's canisters and add a splash of color, not to mention convenience, to your kitchen. The middle canister holds up to four quarts of tea, coffee, sugar, flour, or sweets. A silicone seal on the lid helps keep the contents fresh. Made in France of high-fired stoneware with a non-porous enamel glaze, the canister won't absorb odors or flavors, resists staining and chipping, and is dishwasher-safe. A choice of colors embellishes the exterior of the jar and lid in a graded fashion, from dark to light. The interior is glazed a neutral tone. Le Creuset also makes 2-1/2-quart and 5-quart canisters, as well as smaller spice jars in the same traditional French country style. Enjoy choosing matching or coordinating colors for your Le Creuset baking pans, pie dishes, French ovens, and more. Each makes a great gift and is covered by a lifetime limited warranty against defects. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tFzBd2p3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B0015UVL70","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0015UVL70","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0015UVL70","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
