window.products.push({"id":928250,"name":"KONACO Ground Bird Feeder with Stand - Compact 7\" x 7\" Steel Mesh Tray for Feeding Ground Animal Squirrels - Complete with Reusable Hanging Soda Bottl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sf++0NZ-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KONACO Ground Bird Feeder with Stand and Hanging Bottle Feeder Great Solution We always put quality first as we rely on top-quality materials and innovative manufacturing techniques to develop premium products. Enjoy your lively, vibrant garden with birds chirping. Simple to Use Using the tray cannot be simpler! Look for the perfect shaded spot in your garden where it is visible to birds, squirrels and other animals. Place the tray on the ground, making sure it is stable and level, then fill it up with various seeds. The tray can be placed in on grass, on your patio or on a deep windowsill. Phenomenal Quality The feeder tray is made fromesh steel with a durable frame, high walls and feet. The tray is lightweight and can be moved from one corner to the other with ease. The 7 inch x 7 inch basket is the perfect size to offer maximum capacity to feed multiple birds at one time. The feet ensures stability when placing it on uneven soil or ground, keeping it balanced. The mesh design combined with the stand ensures that seeds stay fresh as it allows for optimal airflow during the day and night. Rain and other moisture will easily drain away keeping the food dry. Easy to Clean Make sure to clean the feeder weekly to prevent blockage of the mesh holes. It is super quick to clean, by simply rinsing with the hose and allowing to dry thoroughly. This process will take only seconds and in return it will ensure long lasting use for years to come. Recycle Old Soda Bottles This all-inone set allows you to feed birds on the ground and also in trees. Attach the bottle feeder to an empty soda bottle, fill with food and hang in a tree. You will see birds flocking by the dozen to the feeder. This is a great opportunity to get the kids involved as the simple design simply twists onto the bottle with no effort at all. What's Included 1 x Ground Bird Feeder (7 inch) - 1 x Bottle Bird Feeder","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sf++0NZ-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KONACO","source_asin":"B08VKRK9F3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VKRK9F3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VKRK9F3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
