window.products.push({"id":928309,"name":"Honey-Can-Do Soft Touch White Plastic Swivel Hangers, 10-Pack HNG-09044 White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+-iy-ZVwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hangers are a thing most people don’t think about unless there’s a problem. Like, clothes are slipping to the floor. A dress strap won’t stay on a notch. Hooks won’t bend or budge to hang over a door (a totally normal place to hang a shirt by the way). Well, these soft touch swivel hangers have solved for these problems. So with these hangers, it’s unlikely that garments will slip past clingy strips on the arms or pants bar, or that camisole straps will escape the deep notches. And a swivel hook makes it easy to hang clothes where you need them, no crazy contortions needed. With all these handy features, what’s most likely to happen? Well, hangers won't be on your mind very often.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+-iy-ZVwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honey-Can-Do","source_asin":"B0924XD64X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0924XD64X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0924XD64X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":928310,"name":"Electric Can Opener - Open the Cans in One Click, Handheld Automatic Can Opener for Almost Size, Smooth Edge Food-Safe Electric Can Openers for Chefs,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AUSdR0R4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🙍Are you tired of how much trouble opening cans might bring? 🙌Thankfully, we're here to help you with the Novamilion Electric Can Openers Our Electric Can Opener is designed to relieve these concerns, which provides the most pleasant and effortless experience while cooking.👍No sharp edges & Super safe👍Work well on most of the can sizes👍Safely removes lids 👉How to Operate the Electric Can Opener? 1. Place the can opener on the top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the cutter and the drive wheel.2. With the can on a flat surface, press the button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can.3. When the cutting has been completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter.4. Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can. 🔑Repair Method 1. If the battery is exhausted, pressing the button may not release the cans. Slide the battery cover back and replace the 2 AA batteries. The electric can opener can continue to cut. Remember to replace the battery.2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow the above procedure to release the can.3. If the can is stuck, press the button at the end of the electric can opener to reverse the cutter. 📇Electric Can Opener Package Includes Electric can opener*1Can opener operation manual *1 📆Electric Can Opener Specifications Size: 2.8*1.8*5.2 inWeight: 0.32 lb","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AUSdR0R4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Novamilion","source_asin":"B0BKRNCQ81","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKRNCQ81","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKRNCQ81","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
