window.products.push({"id":928425,"name":"Yaheetech Modern Wood Lift Top Coffee Table w/Hidden Compartment and Storage Shelf Cabinet for Living Room Reception Room Office, Pop-Up Storage, Mini","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jMldVBuiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅Lift-top design: The tabletop of our coffee table can be effortlessly lifted up and forward to create a workspace when sitting on your sofa. The high-quality metal mechanism enables the tabletop to be lifted or lowered down easily and without noise. ✅Solid table construction: This lift top coffee table is constructed of CARB P2 compliant MDF with water-resistant powder coating, solid pine wood legs and heavy-duty metal mechanism. With the sturdy construction and selected materials, this coffee table will not wobble or tipping once correctly assembled. ✅Storage master: A hidden storage compartment beneath the top is designed to store your often-used items like laptop, chess, remote controllers, game controllers and suchlike under the top when not in use, keeping them handy and dirt-free. The bottom open shelf without baffles can hold blankets, books, snacks and knick-knacks. ✅Minimalist basic furniture: With this versatile lift top table, you don’t need to lean forward so hard to use your laptop, write or dine on the table while relaxing on the couch. The contemporary minimalist look is simple in shape and classic in color, which can seamlessly compatible with your room décor. It can be a practical basic coffee table in the living room, office, reception room, or limited space. ✅Easy assembly: Comes with all necessary hardware and an illustrated instruction manual to help you set up this lift top coffee table quickly and without difficulties.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jMldVBuiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yaheetech","source_asin":"B09DPVG15X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DPVG15X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DPVG15X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":928426,"name":"GreenTech Environmental pureAir 1500 PCO Cell - Replacement ARC Cell for pureAir 1500 - Portable Air Purifier and Air Cleaner, Air Purifiers for Home,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fUmMNVQ6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Technology in Harmony with Nature GreenTech Environmental is best known for its proprietary and multi-pronged air purification technology, Active Radiant Catalysis (ARC), which continuously and actively purifies the air and surfaces in thousands of homes and commercial buildings in the United States. In addition to our air purification systems, we offer products to improve air circulation, heating, power management, and laundry efficiency. Transform Your Space The pureAir 1500 was made with your health in mind. Stop worrying about whether the room is secure from impurities, and trust that pureAir will clean the air throughout your home. pureAir 1500 is ideal for homes or offices up to 1,500 square feet. Cleans the air throughout your home – even while you’re away Neutralizes tough odors pureAir 1500 transforms your space into a continuously fresh and clean environment, reducing airborne impurities. Using advanced technologies, our air purifier significantly reduces odors caused by invisible irritants, pets, cooking, and smoking. How to Remove Locate the PCO Cell Connector (White Connector Piece) on the right side of the unit. Squeeze the tabs on the left and right and gently pull free. Grasp the PCO CELL and gently pull back to remove it from the slot.Fourth feature headline: How to Replace Slide the PCO CELL back into the upper slot with the warning at the top, facing out. Plug the PCO CELL CONNECTOR back into the WHITE CONNECTOR SLOT","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fUmMNVQ6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GreenTech Environmental","source_asin":"B07GNKTVHG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GNKTVHG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GNKTVHG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
