window.products.push({"id":928449,"name":"Ten-Tatent Vacuum Sealer Machine for Food Preservation - Automatic Operation Vacuum Air Sealing System Starter Kit with 10 Vacuum Bags for Food Saver,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819xxSvsWqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE INCLUDE: Vacuum food sealer, user manual, 10 pieces vacuum sealer bags, 1 x power cord. Vacuum sealing system is cleverly designed, removes air from vacuum bags to keep air out. SCIENTIFIC PRESERVATION: Using a vacuum sealer for food storage, quickly drains the air around the food, can help preserve most fruits, vegetables and herbs for weeks in the refrigerator or months in the freezer using a vacuum sealer for food storage, you can avoid wasting food due to oxidation,exposure to odors, and rotting. Cooking and meal preparation will become easier, less expensive and faster. CONVENIENT & EFFICIENT: The food sealer takes up little space in your kitchen and extremely easy to clean, vacuum bin and the sponge around the vacuum bin is removable and washable. Fast vacuum sealing with low vibration, low noise, safety lock design keeps the food sealing machine tightly closed when being operated. EASY TO USE: Vacuum sealing system is cleverly designed owning two optional modes, sealed mode and vacuum seal mode, provide your food with the best possible preservation based on the type of food you want. The control center placed on the top panel and soft buttons, fully automatic operation works with just the touch of a button, add food to the bag, the machine will take care of the rest of the work - remove all air, form a hermetic seal, and automatically stop after the seal is complete. NOT JUST FOR FOOD: Not only for food preservation, but also for non-food items, such as photos, jewellery, antiques, clothes, medication, important paperwork, etc. Easy clean vacuum bin and the sponge around the vacuum bin is removable and washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819xxSvsWqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ten-tatent","source_asin":"B07WP64Q22","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WP64Q22","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WP64Q22","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
