window.products.push({"id":928508,"name":"Hxeredue YuanKanJu Asian Kitchen 10\" Bamboo Steamer Basket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VQUPfhxlL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Product Description Size: 10 inch specifications: 1 lid+2 tiers  Steaming is a more healthier cooking method than deep-frying, quick-frying ,smoking or grilling. It protects the food's minerals and vitamins from being damaged, and keeps their color and flavor. Besides, there is no need to use any oil or fat when cooking with a bamboo steamer. So whether you just want to stay healthy and slim, or you are a kitchen enthusiast that loves Asian food, or you are just learning to cook and want to make your cooking method easier. This bamboo steamer is a good choice for you! Attentions 1.Please make sure you have plenty of water in your pan(This is important!). It would be safe to keep an eye on the water to make sure it doesn't get too low in use, you could set a timer. If the water gets low in use, please add more hot water in it. Or the basket bottom will be burnt.   2.Please be careful of the heat and steam in use, and don't reach to pick it up directly or you will get hit with a bit of steam. It would be safe to use a small potholder.  3.Please don’t leave it too close to the burner, or it might catch fire. IMPORTANT!IMPORTANT!IMPORTANT!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VQUPfhxlL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mirsne","source_asin":"B085ZXF1WR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085ZXF1WR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085ZXF1WR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
