window.products.push({"id":928690,"name":"76Pcs Natural Dried Pampas Grass Fluffy Pompous Dried Flowers Arrangements Pampas Grass, Eucalyptus Branches, Valentiness Grass, Wheat Stalks, Reed, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cwUGNE6QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mix and Match: Including 15 white pampas grass, 5 natural pampas grass, 3 eucalyptus branches, 2 firewood reeds, 1 natural valentiness grass, 7 natural wheat stalks, 30 reed grass, 10 natural bunny tails and 3 craspedia globosa (not include the vase). Our pampas grass are about 16.5-17.7 inches in length, which can be adjusted and cut to desired length! Highest Quality: Our pampas grass are made with superior quality, handpicked and naturally dried flowers, being 100% safe and non-toxic. Stems are durable, cannot break easily. After natural dried. Through our exquisite and careful processing technology, all pampas grass can maintain the most original flower appearance and natural beauty. Widely Use: These pampas grass can be used for house, office, party, garden, hotel, cafes, wedding, balcony, etc. Dried pampas is versatile and perfectin any vase to add a rustic feel to any room. Also a good gift for birthdays and other special events. You can DIY boho dry flower arrangements to make your favourite bouquet. Maintenance Free: These pampas last longer than fresh flowers, requires no maintenance, light or watering. Save your time, money and energy. With money of a bunch of fresh flowers, you can get a year-round flower bouquet. Warm Tips: ①When you open the carton, please pull it out from the bottom of the pole carefully. ②Blooms may be compressed after a long journey, so you can shake it carefully and put the grass in the sun for few hours to make it fluffy. ③It is normal about shedding because it is natural dried plant, but using hairspray after fluffing will greatly reduce the shedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cwUGNE6QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Omerker","source_asin":"B0B93YCQ1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B93YCQ1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B93YCQ1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
