window.products.push({"id":928707,"name":"Tangkula 3-in-1 Industrial Hall Tree, 72.5 Inches Shoe Coat Rack Bench w/Storage Shelf, 9 Hanging Hooks, Wood Look Accent Furniture with Metal Frame, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AjxikbyJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【3-in-1 Multifunctional Design】The hall tree is a perfect combination of hanging rod, coat rack, and shoe rack. A rod hanger and 9 hooks are designed for hanging your coats, scarves and hats. The thick board with a load-bearing of 176lbs can be used as a shoe changing stool and the lower shelves can be used to store shoes neatly. 【Ample Storage Space】The 3-in-1 hall tree combines multiple storage spaces to maximize space utilization. By orderly storing clothes, hats, bags, shoes and other sundries, it can effectively eliminate clutter and obstacles. The slender design makes it possible to use the compact space reasonably, which is definitely the ideal storage solution. 【Rustic & Elegant Style】The simple lines, rustic brown wood tone and elegant matte black finish create a relaxed, reclaimed-style aesthetic. This coat rack can complement a variety of home decoration styles, which is an ideal choice for entrance, bedroom, living room, etc. 【Durable Materials & Sturdy Structure】Made of high-quality MDF board and robust baking painted metal frame, our coat rack has good rust and compression resistance to provide you with long-lasting and stable support. And with 4 adjustable leveling legs, the coat stand can maintain perfect stability on carpets or uneven floors. 【Easy to Assemble & Clean】With detailed assembly instruction and all hardware delivered, it is easy to set up your coat rack. Its smooth surface and rust-proof coating facilitate daily maintenance, the stains left on the rack can be quickly wiped with a soft cloth, which greatly saves your time and labor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AjxikbyJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tangkula","source_asin":"B084ZF91Q6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084ZF91Q6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084ZF91Q6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
