window.products.push({"id":928806,"name":"VictoryStore Slim Can Coolers: Nacho Average Bride Bachelorette Slim Can Coolers Set of 7 (6 Amigos 1 Bride Can Cooler)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UMcXzzBOL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"These WEDDING DECORATIONS and can coolers are the perfect way to say LOVE and a happy union to the new couple! Party supplies and wedding favors will fit into all bridal and celebratory party events. KEEP YOUR DRINK COLD and your hand warm! Bottom acts as coaster, preventing rings on furniture. It also is collapsible for easy storage. They are made of thick material that insulates the coldness more effectively and give you a better grip on the can. Works with most SLIM cans, and glass bottles. QUALITY MADE - These fun and useful beverage coolers have full color digital graphics and are made from high quality insulator for elegance and extra durability for reusable, waterproof outdoor use. They are foldable with sew seams and slotted bottom. BEAUTIFULLY DESIGNED CAN COOLERS – VictoryStore features hundreds of can coolers, coolies and beverage sleeves for all occasions like retirement, graduation and weddings. Imagine these popular can coolers are perfect for backyard BBQs, birthday parties, camping, bonfires, family reunions & picnics, bachelor & bachelorette parties, bridal showers, graduation parties, retirement parties, novelty gifts, Mother's Day, Father's Day, housewarming gift, hostess gift and family gatherings. FAMILY BUSINESS - Founded in 1999, VictoryStore has been a pioneer in the design-your-own space for CAN COOLERS, Christmas decorations, party supplies, promotional products, big cards, apparel, gifts as well as yard, patio and outdoor lawn decorations. Founded by Steve and Kelli Grubbs and is still a family business located in Davenport, Iowa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UMcXzzBOL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VictoryStore","source_asin":"B083C3XSHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083C3XSHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083C3XSHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":928807,"name":"Mix & Match Absorbent Drink Coasters - Handmade by McCarter Coasters - off-white 4.38 inch (4pc)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ipGIDYYJL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"All the moisture disappears and the coaster will never stick to your glass. The porous nature of the clay will allow all liquids to seep slowly into the clay - Other materials do not work as well. 100% natural earthenware clay is the best material for maximum absorption. Hand carved design from clay - 27 years of handcrafted excellence in coasters! McCarter Coasters are extremely absorbent. Condensation from your glass will seep into the porous clay coaster and take-in any liquid. No more drips or stains! Continues to soak-up all day. We don't know where the water goes! Normal use will render a long lasting coaster that will need very little care. To remove stains, spot clean with a mild bleach product. Rinse with water and allow to dry. This will restore the coaster to its original condition. They don't stick to your glass! These are the first coasters I've used that actually work with glasses that sweat. My glass doesn't stick to the coaster and if water sweats off the glass it is absorbed into the coaster. They work wonderfully! There are so many patterns to choose from - you can find something for everyone. The fine textured detail is embossed giving them dimension while the natural off-white color goes with any decor. Set of 4 - Measures 4 3/8\" diameter with cork feet to allow air circulation which prevents moisture from being trapped on the inside and the bottom. Dishwasher safe - You will NOT be disappointed! Absolutely beautiful coasters!!!! They are stunning. They are so pretty I almost didn't want to use them, but I had to try out the absorbency - we had a real hot, humid day yesterday and so all cold drinks ended up dripping like crazy, but this coaster just sucked it right up like advertised. And still look beautiful even when a wet drink has been on it! Perfect addition to my beach-themed living room!! - Jennifer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ipGIDYYJL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"McCarter Coasters","source_asin":"B0755LCHL4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0755LCHL4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0755LCHL4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
