window.products.push({"id":928842,"name":"Magic Trio Peeler 2018 New for Vegetable Fruit (Set of 3)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31X2c+HKQGL._AC_.jpg","description":"One Black 50mm Peeler: General Peeling potatoes, carrots, apples, pumpkin, pineapples, tomatoes. One Blue 68mm Peeler: Cabbage shredder, cheese slicer, ribbons, thin slicing.  One Red Julienne Peeler: Julienne, zucchini noodles, pumpkin spaghetti. Vegetable peeler features dual ultra sharp surgical stainless steel swivel double-edge blade Dual Stainless Steel blades stay ultra sharp and swivel for smooth, effortless peeling The handle is comfortable, even during repetitive strokes  Built-in potato eye remover and orange peeler Dishwasher Safe  Whatever the task, the peeler should handle bumps and curves with ease and without clogging or losing its edge. If that is what you ask from peelers then this amazing Trio Peelers is made for you!  Include: 1 pcs *Black 50mm Peeler 1 pcs *Blue 68mm Peeler 1 pcs *Red Julienne Peele","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31X2c+HKQGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CIVY","source_asin":"B07FB541YM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928842","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FB541YM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FB541YM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":928843,"name":"365FURY Nurse Gifts for Women - Thank You Appreciation Gifts For Nurse Day, Nurse Week, Graduation, Christmas - Nurse Travel Coffe Mug - Stainless Ste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819jZ0b89DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Best Nurse Gifts for Women] - Nurses are true warriors battling an unseen foe. If you're looking for a thoughtful gift to give to a loved one, a friend, or a fellow nurse who gives of herself day and night to care for her patients, the can cooler and keychain gift set is a great choice. Let your beautiful nurse know just how much she is appreciated during Nurse Week, Nurse Graduation, her birthday, or other holidays. [Energy-Boosting Gifts for Nurses] - When the shift begins, it can be difficult for nurses to find time to prepare something energizing, such as a cup of tea or coffee that is kept warm or cold at all times. This Nurse Tumbler Cup with its meaningful message is a thoughtful way to help any dedicated nurse in your life enjoy her favorite drink and be more productive on her busy shift. The keychain in the gift set is a nice touch to show your appreciation for the great work she does. [Premium Features] - Both the can cooler and keychain are made of stainless steel. The double-walled insulation cup can keep the drinks hot for up to 6 hours and cold for 12 hours. The 4-in-1 versatile design fits most 12 oz slim, regular cans and bottles. Plus, you can use it as a tumbler to drink any of your favorite beverages, such as beer, coffee, smoothies, etc. Meanwhile, with the technique of full-bleed print coverage, the present set now looks more colorful and special with no fading. [Daily Usage] - This portable coozie is suitable for indoor and outdoor activities. It fits into most cup holders. Now you can enjoy beer, coffee, tea, milkshake or any favorite beverage at any time, anywhere. [2 Functional Lids] - Sip healthy with our BPA-Free tumblers or use it as a can cooler with a lid gasket. Bring this can coozie with you next time you go to a picnic, hiking adventure, beach outing, pool party, or, of course, volunteering.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819jZ0b89DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"365FURY","source_asin":"B0BBBLWT5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBBLWT5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBBLWT5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
