window.products.push({"id":928994,"name":"Theodore Top Grain Leather Apron - 32.5” H x 24.5” W with Adjustable Crossback Leather Straps. Our Leather Apron for Men has 2 Large Pockets and a Tow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610VzrydIGL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"leather Imported Buckles and adjustable straps closure IDEAL AS GIFTS: Our aprons are for anyone who is the cooking chef, grill master, or who is a carpenter by hobby. Heavy duty and stylish, they are also perfect for the professional butcher, barber, barista, bartender and more. Thoughtful gift for Father's Day. APRON SIZE: 32” H x 24.5” W. Waist Size up to: 44\" COMFORTABLE: The fully adjustable cross back design, with an additional waist strap, distributes weight evenly on your shoulders and back, and take weight off your neck. No more neck pain, so you can wear the apron longer throughout the day. GENUINE TOP GRAIN LEATHER: Our high quality artisanal apron comes in a rich dual brown tone which will become more beautiful with age and wear. It uses only natural dyes using an eco-certified in the tanning process, and it is and easy to clean with just a cloth. PROTECTS YOU AND YOUR CLOTHES: The leather has a durable finish to protect your and your clothes from the heat, flame, saw dust and oil splatters. LARGE TOOL POCKETS: For your accessories, knives or tools. The front vertical strap is ideal for hanging your grilling tongs, and the front horizontal strap will keep your kitchen towel within easy reach. Hang the apron with ease in your kitchen, shop or workshop with the unique inner strap.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610VzrydIGL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Theodore","source_asin":"B08NGRMLGP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NGRMLGP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NGRMLGP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":928995,"name":"Wooden Salt and Pepper Grinder Set -  Adjustable Mills, Refillable Shakers, Zero Waste, No Plastic, Natural Spoon and Brush; Plant a Tree and Help Bui","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uO0AAREOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NATURAL AND SUSTAINABLE LIFE - USA Designed, with no toxins and all sustainable materials. The wood interior will keep your spices natural. and a unique brush eliminates plastics. (It takes 450 years for plastic to decompose!) PREMIUM QUALITY FOR YOUR PEACE OF MIND - Hardwood body and ceramic grinders. Looks great, works great, and grinds out easily.  They are a substantial 8” high with a gorgeous, smooth surface and unique graining in every set. They are chic and look very high end.  Discreet but clearly readable S and P on knobs so no more confusion or ruined food. EASY TO ADJUST AND REFILL - with a slight turn of the knob left or right. Change the grind size to the one you like and get the perfect grind every time.  This salt and pepper grinder set is very efficient, making it easy to grind, clockwise for fine and counter-clockwise for coarse. NO RISK - We are so confident in the quality of our premium salt and pepper grinders that we include a lifetime manufacturer’s guarantee.  If you are unhappy in any way, we can replace your salt and pepper mills so these are the last ones you will ever need to buy. GRINDERS DO GOOD - Wish Gardens is a female disabled Veteran Owned Business that supports sustainable efforts across the globe. We source our products responsibly. With your purchase, we plant a tree and donate to help build disability friendly homes for homeless vets and adults with Autism. In addition, we ourselves have partnerships with several other environmental and ecological efforts to improve the quality of all life. . PACKAGE INCLUDES: Salt Mill,  Pepper Mill,  Wood Spoon,  Natural Bristle Cleaning Brush,  Gift Box,  Instructions (salt and pepper not included) CARE: Wipe with mild organic soap and water, do not immerse. Brush the inside. Add a light coat of organic cooking oil to revitalize the finish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uO0AAREOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wish Gardens","source_asin":"B08W2HYCRL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-928995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W2HYCRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W2HYCRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
